video_component = '<article class="ds-panel ds-component" id="feed-video"><h3>Autoplay feed video</h3><div class="ds-card-layout"><div class="ds-card-specimen">' + video_card + '</div><div class="ds-component-spec"><h4>Five-second loop</h4><p>The second home-feed card animates its existing image with a seamless, silent five-second pan and zoom. It starts muted and plays while in view. Tap once to pause with pause_circle; tap again to play with play_circle. Feedback scales in and fades away over 900ms. It appears at the horizontal center, 40% down the card.</p><p>The 32px volume_off icon sits above Share, Bookmark and the author avatar in the existing rail, using its 32px gaps and 12px right inset. The mute control has a 48px hit area. Material Symbols icons use weight 400 and grade 0. Play and pause are filled lime (#BEFC4F, FILL 1), optical size 48. Volume on is filled lime (#BEFC4F), optical size 32; muted is unfilled (FILL 0), matching the bookmark icon color.</p><p>Explicit reader pauses survive scrolling away and back. Offscreen and background playback pauses automatically; reduced-motion users start with a still poster and can play on demand. Story actions keep their own navigation. This source animation has no soundtrack.</p><p><a class="ds-text-link" href="../feed.html#feed-video-story">Open the second feed story</a></p></div></div></article>'
icons = ['icon-menu.svg', 'icon-theme.svg', 'icon-share.svg', 'icon-bookmark.svg', 'icon-trending-up.svg', 'icon-trending-down.svg']
